格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH plugin: scan other AI agents (Codex, Claude Code, cc-switch, Hermes, opencode, Gemini, Grok, Kimi, CodeBuddy, Trae, OpenClaw, Qoder, WorkBuddy, Cursor, ...) and one-click sync their MCP servers and skills into DSH.","id":"gh:1338497743","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-agent-sync","slug":"kuaiyukuaikuai/dsh-agent-sync","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","mcp","skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH plugin: scan other AI agents (Codex, Claude Code, cc-switch, Hermes, opencode, Gemini, Grok, Kim"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"i, CodeBuddy, Trae, OpenClaw, Qoder, WorkBuddy, Cursor, ...) and one-click sync their MCP servers an"},{"id":"p1s3","text":", OpenClaw, Qoder, WorkBuddy, Cursor, ...) and one-click sync their MCP servers and skills into DSH."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🦾 dsh-agent-sync"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**One-click sync of MCP servers & Skills from 20+ AI agents into DeepSeek Harness**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Scans other AI agents installed on this machine — **Codex, Claude Code, cc-switch,\nHermes, opencode,"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" Gemini, Grok, Kimi, CodeBuddy, Trae, OpenClaw, Qoder, WorkBuddy,\nZcode, Cursor, Windsurf, Cline, Ro"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"o Code, Qwen Code, …** — and syncs their **MCP\nservers** and **Skills** into DSH with one click."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Capability | What it does |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| 🔍 Auto-scan | Reads each agent's real config (`~/.codex/config.toml`, `~/.claude.json`, `~/.cc-swi"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"tch/cc-switch.db`, `~/.codebuddy/mcp.json`, `~/.workbuddy/.mcp.json`, …) and discovers MCP servers +"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" Skills |\n| ⚡ One-click sync MCP | Writes servers as `@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` instances into ea"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ch profile's `cordis.patch.yml` (auto-repairs invalid YAML) → they become `mcp__<server>__<tool>` to"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"ols |\n| 🧠 One-click sync Skills | Copies/links skill bundles into `$DSH_HOME/skills` (**global**) or"},{"id":"p8s6","text":" `<workspace>/.dsh/skills` (**per-workspace**), auto-discovered by DSH's skill-filesystem provider |"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"\n| 🗂️ Scope-aware management | **MCP/Skills 管理** page: enabled/disabled switch, remove, skills group"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"ed by global + each workspace tab |\n| ➕ Add MCP / Skill | Manual add — MCP by form (stdio / streamab"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"le-http), Skill from a **folder / single .md / .zip** (or drag & drop) into global or a workspace |\n"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"| ⇄ Migrate Skills | Move or **copy** skills between global / workspaces (migrate dialog, multi-sele"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"ct) |\n| 🏷️ Skill groups | Create named groups, bind skills, filter the list by group |\n| 📄 Skill con"},{"id":"p8s12","text":"tent view | Click a skill → detail modal shows metadata **and the SKILL.md body** |\n| 🗑️ Delete conf"},{"id":"p8s13","text":"irm | Remove buttons arm a 3-second inline confirm (auto-reverts) |\n| ⚙️ Config | **Skill sync mode*"},{"id":"p8s14","text":"* (copy / link/junction) + **MCP sync target** (all / desktop / web profiles) from the ⚙️ settings d"},{"id":"p8s15","text":"ialog |\n| 🔀 Enable / Disable | Toggle any synced MCP server or skill on/off — disabled MCPs are drop"},{"id":"p8s16","text":"ped from the profile patch, disabled skills have their `SKILL.md` renamed to `SKILL.md.disabled` (hi"},{"id":"p8s17","text":"dden, fully reversible) |\n| 🖥️ GUI panel | Settings → **MCP/Skills**: centered MCP/Skills switch, ca"},{"id":"p8s18","text":"psule tabs & buttons, card grid, search |\n| 🛠️ Model tools | `agent_sync_scan` / `agent_sync_do` / `"},{"id":"p8s19","text":"agent_sync_status` / `agent_sync_config` / `agent_sync_add_skill` / `agent_sync_toggle` / `agent_syn"},{"id":"p8s20","text":"c_remove` / `agent_sync_sources` |\n| 🧩 Extensible | A generic agent registry (`AGENT_DEFS`) — adding"},{"id":"p8s21","text":" a new agent is one line |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 📸 Screenshots"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| MCP/Skills 管理 | MCP/Skills 同步 | 添加技能 |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- A running DSH (desktop or headless) with **Node.js ≥ 22.5**\n- The agents you want to sync must be "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"installed on the same machine (nothing is shipped with the plugin)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Install"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Option A — as a profile bundle (recommended)**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Add `dsh-agent-sync` to your profile's `dsh.profile.bundles` and install it:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Restart DSH. The bundled `cordis.patch.yml` mounts the plugin automatically."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Option B — manual row**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Place the package where your profile can resolve it, then append to\n`$DSH_HOME/profiles/<name>/cordi"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"kage where your profile can resolve it, then append to\n`$DSH_HOME/profiles/<name>/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Restart DSH."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 📖 Usage"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### GUI panel"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**Settings → MCP/Skills** (main page **MCP/Skills 管理**)"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **Manage (main page)** — a centered **MCP / Skills** switch; card grid where each card has a **tog"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"gle switch** (enable/disable in one control) and a **remove button with a 3-second inline confirm**;"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" disabled items are greyed with a badge. **Skills are grouped by scope**: global (`~/.dsh/skills`) a"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"nd per-workspace (`<workspace>/.dsh/skills`) with workspace tabs + a search box + skill-group filter"},{"id":"p26s5","text":" chips.\n- **Toolbar (right of the switch)** — **⇄ 迁移技能** (migrate/copy skills between scopes) and **"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"＋ 添加 MCP / ＋ 添加 Skill** (manual add).\n- **MCP/Skills同步 →** — a button that opens the sync page: per-"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"source tabs (common agents + \"More ▾\"), select-all, sync buttons (choose **global or a workspace** a"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"s the skill target), custom sources.\n- **＋ 添加 Skill** dialog — pick a **folder** (bundle), a **singl"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"e .md**, or a **.zip** — or **drag & drop** any of those onto the dialog; choose the target scope (g"},{"id":"p26s10","text":"lobal / workspace).\n- **⚙️ 设置** dialog — **Skill 同步方式** (copy / link=junction) and **MCP 同步目标** (all"},{"id":"p26s11","text":" / desktop / web profiles)."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"> **UI implementation** — no component library. The panel is vanilla React (`React.createElement`) s"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"tyled with DSH's theme tokens (`--dsw-alias-*`), capsule tabs/buttons, and a small custom CSS toggle"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"th DSH's theme tokens (`--dsw-alias-*`), capsule tabs/buttons, and a small custom CSS toggle switch."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## 🔧 How it works"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- **MCP** is written into each profile's `cordis.patch.yml` (a managed `# --- dsh-agent-sync managed"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" ---` section, repaired if the file was invalid). The desktop GUI shell composes once at boot, so **"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"MCP activates on the next DSH restart**; the `dsh` CLI / headless boot hot-applies profile patches v"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ia HMR.\n- **Skills** are copied (default) or **linked via junction** (`skillSyncMode: link`) into `$"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"DSH_HOME/skills` (global) or `<workspace>/.dsh/skills` (per-workspace), and discovered by sessions w"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"hose agent preset mounts the `skill-filesystem` provider. In link mode, disabling a skill removes th"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"e junction (never touches the source); enabling recreates it."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## ⚠️ Security notes"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- Syncing MCP **copies env values verbatim** (DB passwords, API keys, …) into `cordis.patch.yml` and"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" `$DSH_HOME/agent-sync/state.json` — same plaintext exposure as the source configs already have.\n- S"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"can output only lists **env key names, never values**.\n- Treat `state.json` / patch files as secrets"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"; consider a token with an expiry and prefer environment-variable references where possible."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
